### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = {{loginCookie.response.headers.Set-Cookie}}

### ============================================================
### ROLES API (AdminOnly)
### ============================================================

### List all roles
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/
Cookie: {{token}}

### Get role by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}

### Create a new role
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
    "name": "Editor",
    "description": "Editor role with content management permissions",
    "permissions": []
}

### Update a role
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie: {{token}}

{
    "name": "Senior Editor",
    "description": "Senior editor role"
}

### Delete a role
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/roles/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
Cookie: {{token}}
